## Vendored application manifests

`app-charts/charts/bookinfo` vendors Kubernetes manifests from
[istio/istio](https://github.com/istio/istio) (tag `1.30.2`), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Copyright Istio Authors.

`app-charts/charts/otel-demo` depends on the official
[OpenTelemetry Demo Helm chart](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-helm-charts)
(`opentelemetry-demo` @ `0.40.9`), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors.

Both applications, and the pinned versions used, were selected to match
[ITBench](https://github.com/itbench-hub/ITBench) (also Apache License,
Version 2.0, Copyright IBM Corp.), so that ACE's fault-injection
experiments against them are comparable to ITBench's published SRE
scenarios. See `it_bench_arxiv.pdf` citation in ITBench's README for the
underlying paper.

